Your mighty blows inspire utter terror on your foes. Any melee strike you do that deals more than [49%, 37%, 30%, 26%, 23% (TL1-5)] of the target's total life puts them in a mortal terror, dazing them for 5 turns.

Your critical strike chance also increase by [2%, 6%, 9%, 11%, 14% (TL1-5)].

The daze chance increase with your Physical Power.
